00:57:00,113 --> 00:57:04,913
物心付く頃 既に此処にあった
By the time I was old enough to understand, it was already here

667
00:57:05,313 --> 00:57:09,913
僕じゃない誰かの記憶は 夕日と共に蘇る
Someone else's memories that aren't mine come flooding back with the setting sunset

668
00:57:10,413 --> 00:57:15,913
古ぼけた絵本を取り出して 落書きの中に 1つの答えを見つけた
Pulling out a worn-out picture book, amidst the scribbles I found one answer

669
00:57:16,213 --> 00:57:20,913
自分の価値観を疑って どこまでだって堕ちていけるの
Doubting my own worth, wondering just how far down I can fall

670
00:57:21,413 --> 00:57:26,413
生きてるだけ無駄だって 私の事なんて見捨ててよ
"It's useless just being alive," abandon me already

671
00:57:26,713 --> 00:57:31,713
どうせ邪魔になって 迷惑ばかりかけてしまうからね
After all, I'll just get in the way and cause trouble for everyone

672
00:57:32,413 --> 00:57:37,413
どんな救いの言葉も 聴き飽きたから 耳塞いでさ
I'm sick of hearing any comforting words, so I cover my ears

673
00:57:37,913 --> 00:57:42,413
花びらたちと共に散って 楽になりたいよ ずっとかくれんぼっち
Scattering away together with the flower petals, I just want to find peace, always playing hide-and-seek all alone

674
00:57:43,413 --> 00:57:47,113
いくらでも文句言えるよ その先に何もなくてさ
You can complain all you want, but there's nothing waiting at the end of it

675
00:57:47,413 --> 00:57:50,913
こんな負の連鎖 飼い馴らして 他に趣味無いの?
Taming this negative chain like that, don't you have any other hobbies?

676
00:57:51,113 --> 00:57:54,913
目に毒だって解ってるけど 見なきゃ気が済まないんだよ
I know it's poison to my eyes, but I can't help myself unless I look at it

677
00:57:55,113 --> 00:57:58,713
だから止まない雨を見ている その汚い雨を
That's why I keep watching the ceaseless rain, that filthy rain

678
00:57:59,113 --> 00:58:00,013
もういいかい？
Ready or not?

679
00:58:00,113 --> 00:58:00,913
まだだよ
Not yet!

680
00:58:01,113 --> 00:58:03,413
幕は上がり出した
The curtain has risen.

681
00:58:04,113 --> 00:58:05,013
もういいかい？
Ready or not?

682
00:58:05,113 --> 00:58:06,013
まだだよ
Not yet!

683
00:58:06,113 --> 00:58:09,413
色付けていく ここから
Adding color from here on out

684
00:58:19,913 --> 00:58:24,413
十年後の僕らは すれ違いばかりで
Ten years from now, we'll just keep passing each other by,

685
00:58:24,713 --> 00:58:28,913
現象に思いを馳せては 戻れない
dwelling on phenomena, unable to return.

686
00:58:29,213 --> 00:58:33,413
さぁ思い込んだ 傷だらけ 心に
Come on, into this scarred, self-absorbed heart,

687
00:58:33,713 --> 00:58:38,413
澱みを あの頃と変わらない夕日も
stagnation... and the sunset that hasn't changed since back then,

688
00:58:38,713 --> 00:58:41,413
何とも思わない
I don't feel a thing about them anymore.

689
00:58:41,913 --> 00:58:46,113
自分を信じ 歩いてければ どこまでだって
If I could just believe in myself and keep walking,

690
00:58:46,413 --> 00:58:51,413
登れるのに なぜか矛盾するその空白に
no matter how high I climb, why does this contradictory void

691
00:58:51,713 --> 00:58:55,913
大切なもの見落としている
make me overlook what's truly precious?

692
00:58:56,213 --> 00:59:01,913
見つけられないと 泣き叫ぶ 君へ
To you, crying out that you can't find it—

693
00:59:02,413 --> 00:59:07,413
いっせーのーで声を上げて 聴こえてくるんだ
Raise your voice on "one, two, three" and hear it echo out!

694
00:59:07,713 --> 00:59:12,413
自分の影の長さに気付く ももこんな時間だ
Realizing the length of my shadow, and that it's already this late.

695
00:59:12,713 --> 00:59:17,413
一等星が顔を出した 孤独で手を伸ばした
The first-magnitude star poked its head out; feeling lonely, I reached out my hand.

696
00:59:17,713 --> 00:59:22,413
次は僕に付いてきなよ どんな暗闇でも
Next time, follow me through any darkness!

697
00:59:22,713 --> 00:59:26,913
もういいかい まだだよ
Ready or not? Not yet!

698
00:59:27,113 --> 00:59:29,913
幕は上がり出した
The curtain has risen.

699
00:59:30,113 --> 00:59:31,913
もういいかい まだだよ
Ready or not? Not yet!

700
00:59:32,113 --> 00:59:34,913
色付けていく ここから
Adding color from here on out.

701
00:59:39,913 --> 00:59:44,913
宝箱は ホコリを 被ったままなくした
The treasure chest was lost, covered in dust.

702
00:59:45,213 --> 00:59:49,913
鍵はずっと 君の ポケットの中にあった
The key was always inside your pocket.

703
00:59:50,213 --> 00:59:54,913
ちらばっていた全てが 今ひとつに重なる
Everything that was scattered now overlaps into one.

704
00:59:55,413 --> 01:00:00,913
手を取り始めよう 僕たちの物語
Let's take each other's hands and begin our story.

705
01:00:01,319 --> 01:00:04,469
億千万のハートブレイク
Hundreds of millions of heartbreaks,

706
01:00:04,969 --> 01:00:07,039
この青い星を抉る
gouging out this blue star.

707
01:00:07,169 --> 01:00:10,539
吐き捨てた台詞はイノセンス
The words I spat out were innocence,

708
01:00:10,869 --> 01:00:14,139
見つけて欲しくて泣いている
crying out because I wanted you to find me.

709
01:00:14,369 --> 01:00:16,539
曇りのち雨
Cloudy, later rain.

710
01:00:16,769 --> 01:00:19,539
かくれんぼする もういいかい？
Playing hide-and-seek. Are you ready?

711
01:00:19,669 --> 01:00:21,939
まだだよ falling down まだだよ
Not yet, falling down, not yet.

712
01:00:22,139 --> 01:00:24,939
もう探さないで…
Stop looking for me now...

713
01:00:25,039 --> 01:00:28,539
ビルの隙間に覗く笑い
A smile peeking through the gaps of buildings,

714
01:00:28,739 --> 01:00:31,939
low を誤魔化すためだけの high
a high just to disguise the low.

715
01:00:32,139 --> 01:00:34,939
吸い殻と抜け殻捨てて fly
Throw away cigarette butts and empty shells and fly,

716
01:00:35,139 --> 01:00:37,539
だけど僕らに帰る場所はない
but we have nowhere left to go home to.

717
01:00:37,739 --> 01:00:41,439
いつからか君は 薬がないと笑えなくなってった
Before I knew it, you couldn't smile without pills.

718
01:00:41,739 --> 01:00:46,039
何度追いかけても「大丈夫 僕はこんな運命だ」ってさ
No matter how much I chase: "I'm fine, this is my destiny."

719
01:00:46,339 --> 01:00:48,039
もういいかい？
Are you ready?

720
01:00:48,039 --> 01:00:49,339
まだだよ
Not yet.

721
01:00:49,439 --> 01:00:51,839
痛みも苦しみも say good bye
Say goodbye to the pain and suffering.

722
01:00:51,839 --> 01:00:54,039
半分噛み砕いて all night
Chewing it halfway down all night,

723
01:00:54,039 --> 01:00:57,039
overdose してるみたい
like I'm overdosing.

724
01:00:57,239 --> 01:00:58,639
もういいかい？
Are you ready?

725
01:00:58,639 --> 01:01:00,039
まだだよ
Not yet.

726
01:01:00,139 --> 01:01:03,139
わかってる君は精一杯 そんなに謝らなくても i know
I know you're trying your best, you don't have to apologize so much, I know.

727
01:01:03,239 --> 01:01:07,139
手を繋いでいて i know you been feeling down
Hold my hand, I know you been feeling down.

728
01:01:07,539 --> 01:01:10,539
been looking for you all around town

729
01:01:10,739 --> 01:01:14,139
can you hear me calling can you hear me calling

730
01:01:14,239 --> 01:01:16,939
億千万のストーリー
Hundreds of millions of stories,

731
01:01:17,139 --> 01:01:19,539
この青い星を抉る
gouging out this blue star.

732
01:01:19,739 --> 01:01:21,939
速度は増していくエンドレス
The speed increases endlessly,

733
01:01:22,139 --> 01:01:24,539
動けずに肩をすぼめる i said i’m sorry
unable to move, huddling my shoulders. I said I'm sorry.

734
01:01:24,839 --> 01:01:28,439
あの日渡した手紙は今日君の部屋の片隅の方
The letter I gave you that day is still in a corner of your room,

735
01:01:28,739 --> 01:01:30,539
ただ落ちたままだったよ
just left fallen there.

736
01:01:30,639 --> 01:01:33,869
Thank you! This is the best bday ever!

737
01:03:50,219 --> 01:03:55,519
thank you for the best bday ever!

738
01:03:55,519 --> 01:04:01,019
without you guys i never would have come this far

739
01:04:01,019 --> 01:04:06,519
this idol rat will continue doing her best!
and this idol rat will continue doing her best!

